  "answer": "**Plant Swap at the Courtyard!**\n\nDo you have a cutting that's taking over the windowsill, or seedlings that need a new home? Come to our plant swap and trade them for something new.\n\n**When:** Saturday 21 November, 11:00 to 14:00\n**Where:** Courtyard of the Linden Street community house\n\nBring cuttings, seedlings or pots, and label each one with the plant's name so everyone knows what they're taking home. Any plants left at the end will go to the school garden, so nothing goes to waste.\n\nQuestions? Ask Tobias Wren, flat 3B.\n\nWe hope to see you there!"
